  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Commercial Arithmetic III: net pay from a payslip</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Essential 2.4 (e): Find the taxable pay, the PAYE and the net pay from a monthly payslip with a pension contribution before tax and other deductions after tax.</p><p id="edition">Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is original to this project.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
